{"pageProps":{"meta":{"id":"obsidian:ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow","title":"我用 AI + 命令行，零设计软件做了一套频道品牌素材","date":"2026-03-26","updated":"2026-03-26","summary":"用 Gemini 生成 logo 概念图，再用 ImageMagick 命令行裁切、去背、批量生成全平台品牌素材。零设计软件，全程命令行完成。","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-工具","name":"工具","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-2-教程","name":"教程","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-3-Linux","name":"Linux","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-4-图片","name":"图片","color":"default"}],"image":"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-01-9a7b151514.png","coverBlockId":null,"slug":"ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow","legacyPaths":[],"lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"我用 AI + 命令行，零设计软件做了一套频道品牌素材","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"source":"markdown","fixedProductFooter":true},"markdownHtml":"<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>【让AI成为你的超能力】欢迎访问我们的网站\n<strong>网站</strong>：<a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · https://hyphentech.top/\"><strong>https://hyphentech.top</strong></a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p>频道改名「黑粉科技 HyphenTech」之后，第一件事就是做一套全新的品牌素材：头像、YouTube Banner、B站横幅……</p>\n<p>我不会 Photoshop，也没装 Figma。整个过程只用了两样东西：<strong>Gemini（生成概念图）</strong> 和 <strong>ImageMagick（命令行裁切合成）</strong>。</p>\n<p>这篇文章完整记录了从 AI 出图到全平台素材落地的全过程，包括中间踩的坑。</p>\n<h3>最终效果</h3>\n<p>最终的 HTI 图标已经部署到了 YouTube、B站和微信公众号，三个平台的品牌视觉完全统一：</p>\n<h4>YouTube 频道</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-01-9a7b151514.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/f0bef9ca1cb001f3dd1228c4-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/f0bef9ca1cb001f3dd1228c4-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-01-9a7b151514.png\" alt=\"YouTube 频道页\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"700\"></picture></a></p>\n<h4>微信公众号</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-02-937b6f6fa2.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/fb2dcc33defdb1e09be94448-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/fb2dcc33defdb1e09be94448-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-02-937b6f6fa2.png\" alt=\"WeChat 公众号设置页\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1890\" height=\"761\"></picture></a></p>\n<h4>B站空间</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-03-c934946690.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/5bf8c91448bdee860d0694bc-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/5bf8c91448bdee860d0694bc-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-03-c934946690.png\" alt=\"B站空间页\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"961\"></picture></a></p>\n<h4>最终素材文件</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-04-6243cbf9d1.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/d0b6f5f7a91f8bbc202406bf-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/d0b6f5f7a91f8bbc202406bf-800.webp 800w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-04-6243cbf9d1.png\" alt=\"Avatar 800×800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-05-9d7cdfc351.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/cdffc5cfd16acc3f9b4be404-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/cdffc5cfd16acc3f9b4be404-1280.webp 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-05-9d7cdfc351.png\" alt=\"YouTube Banner 2560×1440\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1125\"></picture></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>全部由同一张 AI 生成的源图衍生而来。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Step 1：用 Gemini 生成 Logo 概念图</h3>\n<h4>提示词</h4>\n<p>我给 Gemini 的提示词大致如下：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">Design a modern, minimalist logo for a tech YouTube channel called &quot;黑粉科技&quot; (HyphenTech).\n- Letters &quot;HTI&quot; as the main icon mark, styled as bold italic parallelograms (≈11° shear)\n- Color scheme: cyan (#2DD4BF) for letters, amber (#FBAB18) dot between T and I\n- Dark background (#1A2332)\n- Clean, geometric, suitable for avatars and banners\n</code></pre>\n<h4>迭代过程：生了几十张才挑到一张</h4>\n<p>AI 生成 logo 的最大问题是<strong>不可控</strong>。同一个提示词跑十次，出来十种完全不同的形状。</p>\n<p>我前前后后生成了大概 <strong>30+ 张</strong>概念图，涵盖了各种变体——有的字母比例不对，有的倾斜角度太大，有的风格偏卡通。最终从中挑出一张形状最接近预期的作为源图。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-06-cd68a95e8e.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/7fe6fc871d34d63bf77e443b-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/7fe6fc871d34d63bf77e443b-900.webp 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-06-cd68a95e8e.jpg\" alt=\"Gemini 迭代过程 1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"1925\"></picture></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-07-be0a683164.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"article-image-link\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/media-previews/0757cbc22df5635ac16bfec8-640.webp 640w, /media-previews/0757cbc22df5635ac16bfec8-900.webp 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) calc(100vw - 40px), 1000px\"><img src=\"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/ai-logo-brand-assets-workflow/image-07-be0a683164.jpg\" alt=\"Gemini 迭代过程 2\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"900\" height=\"1925\"></picture></a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>经验</strong>：AI 生成的 logo 是位图，不可能直接当矢量用，但形状可以作为基础。与其反复调整提示词追求完美，不如多生成、快速筛选。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4>其他 AI 工具也可以</h4>\n<p>Gemini 之外，DALL-E 3、Ideogram、Midjourney 都可以生成概念图。Ideogram 的文字渲染相对更准确，如果 logo 中有文字元素可以优先试试。</p>\n<h3>Step 2：ImageMagick 裁切与去背</h3>\n<p>选定源图后，接下来全部在命令行完成。</p>\n<h4>安装 ImageMagick</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># Arch Linux\nsudo pacman -S imagemagick\n\n# Ubuntu/Debian\nsudo apt install imagemagick\n\n# macOS\nbrew install imagemagick\n</code></pre>\n<h4>裁切 Logo 区域</h4>\n<p>从 AI 生成的大图中，裁切出仅包含 logo 图标的区域：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">magick source.png -crop 1900x1000+430+10 +repage logo-crop.png\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p>宁可裁大不裁小，后面会自动 trim。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4>去除背景（透明化）</h4>\n<p>AI 生成的图片背景不是纯色，有微妙的光照渐变。用 floodfill 从四个角灌入透明色：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">magick logo-crop.png \\\n  -alpha set \\\n  -fuzz 25% \\\n  -fill none \\\n  -draw &quot;color 0,0 floodfill&quot; \\\n  -draw &quot;color 1899,0 floodfill&quot; \\\n  -draw &quot;color 0,999 floodfill&quot; \\\n  -draw &quot;color 1899,999 floodfill&quot; \\\n  -trim +repage \\\n  logo-transparent.png\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示</strong>\n<strong>为什么用 floodfill 而不是 -transparent？</strong>\n<code>-transparent &quot;#1A2332&quot;</code> 只能按颜色精确匹配，会漏掉渐变区域。floodfill 从边角向内扩散，能自然跟随渐变边界，适合 AI 生成图的特点。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示</strong>\n<strong>-fuzz 参数调节指南</strong>\n15%：保守，可能留残影\n25%：推荐起点（多数 AI 生成图的甜点值）\n35%：激进，可能吃掉深色细节</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3>Step 3：批量生成全套品牌素材</h3>\n<p>有了透明背景的 logo 源文件，就可以批量生成所有平台需要的素材。</p>\n<h4>头像（800×800）</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">magick -size 800x800 xc:&quot;#1A2332&quot; \\\n  \\( logo-transparent.png -resize 580x \\) \\\n  -gravity center -geometry +0-30 -composite \\\n  avatar-800x800.png\n</code></pre>\n<h4>YouTube Banner（2560×1440）</h4>\n<p>YouTube 横幅在不同设备上可见区域差异很大。<strong>所有关键内容必须在手机安全区（1546×423 居中）内</strong>：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">magick -size 2560x1440 xc:&quot;#1A2332&quot; \\\n  \\( logo-transparent.png -resize x260 \\) \\\n  -gravity center -geometry -280+0 -composite \\\n  -gravity center \\\n  -font &quot;Noto-Sans-CJK-SC&quot; -pointsize 72 -fill &quot;#F4F4F3&quot; -kerning 10 \\\n  -annotate +180-30 &quot;黑粉科技&quot; \\\n  -font &quot;Inter&quot; -pointsize 30 -fill &quot;#F4F4F3&quot; -kerning 6 \\\n  -annotate +180+30 &quot;HYPHENTECH&quot; \\\n  -font &quot;Noto-Sans-CJK-SC&quot; -pointsize 22 -fill &quot;#9CA3AF&quot; \\\n  -annotate +180+75 &quot;让AI成为你的超能力&quot; \\\n  banner-youtube-2560x1440.png\n</code></pre>\n<p>验证安全区可以画参考线检查：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">magick banner-youtube-2560x1440.png \\\n  -strokewidth 2 \\\n  -stroke &quot;#FF4444&quot; -fill none -draw &quot;rectangle 507,508 2053,931&quot; \\\n  -stroke &quot;#FBAB18&quot; -fill none -draw &quot;rectangle 352,508 2207,931&quot; \\\n  -stroke &quot;#2DD4BF&quot; -fill none -draw &quot;rectangle 0,508 2560,931&quot; \\\n  banner-safezone-check.png\n</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p>红色=手机安全区，琥珀色=平板，青色=桌面。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h4>B站 Banner（2048×320）</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">magick -size 2048x320 xc:&quot;#1A2332&quot; \\\n  \\( logo-transparent.png -resize 170x \\) \\\n  -gravity north -geometry +0+15 -composite \\\n  -gravity center \\\n  -font &quot;Noto-Sans-CJK-SC&quot; -pointsize 40 -fill &quot;#F4F4F3&quot; -kerning 8 \\\n  -annotate +0+62 &quot;黑粉科技&quot; \\\n  -font &quot;Inter&quot; -pointsize 18 -fill &quot;#F4F4F3&quot; -kerning 6 \\\n  -annotate +0+100 &quot;HYPHENTECH&quot; \\\n  banner-bilibili-2048x320.png\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Step 4：一键脚本</h3>\n<p>整个流程可以串成一个 Bash 脚本，修改变量即可复用：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">#!/bin/bash\n# generate-brand-assets.sh\nset -e\n\nSOURCE=&quot;$1&quot;\nBG_COLOR=&quot;${2:-#1A2332}&quot;\nBRAND_CN=&quot;黑粉科技&quot;\nBRAND_EN=&quot;HYPHENTECH&quot;\nSLOGAN=&quot;让AI成为你的超能力&quot;\n\n# ... 裁切 → 去背 → 生成头像 → 生成 banner\n# 完整脚本见文末\n</code></pre>\n<h3>踩坑记录</h3>\n<h4>坑 1：SVG trace 路线（失败）</h4>\n<p>最初尝试用 potrace 将位图 trace 成 SVG 矢量路径。虽然形状大致对，但 AI 生成图有光照渐变和抗锯齿，trace 出的边缘不够锐利，字母间的缝隙和倾斜角度有微妙偏差。反复手调坐标效率极低。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：除非有干净的黑白矢量输入，否则直接裁切 PNG 更靠谱。</p>\n<h4>坑 2：字体问题</h4>\n<p>ImageMagick 的 <code>-font</code> 需要系统上安装的字体名。没有中文字体时需要额外安装：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># Arch\nsudo pacman -S noto-fonts-cjk\n# Ubuntu\nsudo apt install fonts-noto-cjk\n</code></pre>\n<p>查看可用字体：<code>magick -list font | grep -i &quot;noto\\\\|inter&quot;</code></p>\n<h4>坑 3：-fuzz 参数</h4>\n<p>这个参数控制颜色匹配的容忍度。太小（&lt;15%）背景残留，太大（&gt;35%）logo 深色部分被误删。25% 是多数 AI 生成图的最佳起点。</p>\n<h3>最终产物清单</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文件</th>\n<th>尺寸</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>logo-transparent.png</td>\n<td>~930×830</td>\n<td>透明背景源 logo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>avatar-800.png</td>\n<td>800×800</td>\n<td>YouTube/B站/GitHub 头像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>banner-youtube.png</td>\n<td>2560×1440</td>\n<td>YouTube 频道横幅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>banner-bilibili.png</td>\n<td>2048×320</td>\n<td>B站空间横幅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>logo-icon-380.png</td>\n<td>380px 宽</td>\n<td>网页/文档/水印</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>logo-icon-32.png</td>\n<td>32px 宽</td>\n<td>Favicon</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>总结</h3>\n<p>这套工作流的核心思路是：<strong>让 AI 负责创意（形状），让命令行负责工程（裁切、合成、批量生成）</strong>。</p>\n<p>对于个人创作者来说，不需要学 Photoshop 或 Figma，一个 AI 工具 + 一行 ImageMagick 命令就能搞定全平台品牌素材。整个过程可复现、可脚本化，下次改名或调色只需要改几个变量。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>黑粉科技 | <a href=\"http://hyphentech.top/\" class=\"resource-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" data-link-kind=\"website\" title=\"在新窗口打开 · http://hyphentech.top/\">hyphentech.top</a> | 让AI成为你的超能力</p>\n</blockquote>\n","relatedPosts":[{"id":"obsidian:wifi-finder-vibe-coding","rawId":"obsidian:wifi-finder-vibe-coding","slug":"wifi-finder-vibe-coding","legacyPaths":[],"title":"我用AI做了个全球公共WiFi密码查询器","date":"2026-03-31","updated":"2026-03-31","summary":"用 Vibe Coding 花 30 分钟做了一个覆盖 15+ 国家、150+ 热点的离线公共 WiFi 密码查询器","categories":[{"id":"markdown-category-0-技术分享","name":"技术分享","color":"default"}],"categoryNames":["技术分享"],"tags":[{"id":"markdown-tag-0-AI","name":"AI","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-1-wifi","name":"wifi","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-2-工具","name":"工具","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-3-教程","name":"教程","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-4-html","name":"html","color":"default"},{"id":"markdown-tag-5-前端","name":"前端","color":"default"}],"pageCover":"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/wifi-finder-vibe-coding/image-01-cf0f87a731.png","cover":"https://hyphentech.top/obsidian-assets/wifi-finder-vibe-coding/image-01-cf0f87a731.png","source":"markdown","status":"published","lang":"zh-CN","translationOf":null,"articleType":"article","discoveryName":"我用AI做了个全球公共WiFi密码查询器","discoveryCategory":null,"discoveryStage":null,"discoveryUrl":null,"sourcePath":"posts/wifi-finder-vibe-coding.md","fixedProductFooter":true},{"id":"obsidian:remotion-claude-code-prompt-to-video-guide","rawId":"obsidian:remotion-claude-code-prompt-to-video-guide","slug":"remotion-claude-code-prompt-to-video-guide","legacyPaths":[],"title":"用Remotion + Claude Code从零做一个AI视频","date":"2026-03-24","updated":"2026-03-24","summary":"一篇面向开发者的Re